      "params_digest": "b290df5c8dddef68",
      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Examine the appendix, resolve case paths via CLI, and run corpus queries for historical priors.\", \"summary\": \"Read the prediction prompt, schemas, statpack, event definition, context.json, snapshot (2026-10-28.json), and petition/lower-court opinion for Marshall Grace v. United States (26-459). Next, reading appendix.txt and running the required fedcourts CLI commands to resolve paths and query corpus priors.\", \"title\": \"Corpus Retrieval and Record Analysis\"}",
